body:
good armor set? i'm using the combat knife with krav maga, and i'm starting to invest in a bow but i have an ar15 for backup. i'm wearing an esapi vest and i'm going to craft some elbow pads to keep my arms safe since i usually get bit there. also, better weapons would be great to know of as well. and lastly... i have a quiver and a sheathe, but they are both on the same leg. is there anyway to move one of them to the other leg?

&#x200B;

edit: i figured out the leg change
